@k.alpha-research:K{ap=[transparent_sprites];ck=[~61:Selected translucent regions retain nonzero, nonopaque alpha.,~66:Round-trip RGBA matches and chosen blend produces no matte fringe.];nm=~43:alpha-contract: candidate for lantern proof;op=[~49:Keep alpha independent of RGB palette membership.,~65:Retain full alpha and verify the chosen export/compositing route.,~66:Review light/dark backgrounds and actual import before acceptance.];rk=[~85:The cited prose is about channels/alignment/CSS, not a complete compositing pipeline.,~52:Bundled numeric POC proves no GPU/importer behavior.];rq=[~79:Chosen alpha model and destination renderer; project sample proof still needed.];so=[@s.recipe,@s.channels,@s.alignment,@s.archive,@s.fixture,@s.research]}
