@project:P{br=~256:Review translucent-reference.png and prepare a production approach for a small matching lantern prop. Preserve intentional partial transparency and selective anti-aliasing. No fixed palette has been imposed. Scope: reference review and production planning.;in=[@i.scope,@i.alpha,@i.palette,@i.edges,@i.reference,@i.style,@i.canvas,@i.view,@i.sampling,@i.light,@i.shape,@i.alpha-model,@i.anchor,@i.engine,@i.display];nm=~25:Translucent lantern study;ow=@user;sc=[@s.brief,@s.image,@s.measure,@s.visual,@s.research]}
@q.approach:Q{ck=~306:Written approach separates user constraints, measurements/visual observations, proposals and unknowns; explicitly preserves full alpha and selective AA without a fixed palette; cites actual method sources and limits; defines one representative sample and separate mechanical, visual and destination checks.;dm=other;md=local;nm=~40:Reference-grounded approach completeness;so=[@s.brief,@s.measure,@s.visual,@s.research];wh=@actor}
@q.sample-edge-mask:Q{ck=~259:Retain a pre-AA raster and explicit mask for allowed AA/translucency edits. Pixel diff is confined to that mask and protected hard frame pixels remain byte-identical. Alpha/ramp values may change by authoring judgment; do not impose the source's exact counts.;dm=mechanical;md=local;nm=~38:Selected edge mask and protected frame;so=[@s.research,@s.brief];wh=@actor}
@q.sample-edges:Q{ck=~320:Inspect actual post-export sample at 1x and 8x on all diagnostic backgrounds. Partial-alpha strips are localized, opaque structure remains crisp, the warm light remains distinct, and no opaque matte fringe or unplanned uniform soft outline appears. Record dark-background contrast concerns; engine rendering is separate.;dm=visual;md=visual;nm=~35:Selective AA compositing appearance;so=[@s.visual,@s.research,@s.brief];wh=@actor}
@q.sample-mechanics:Q{ck=~283:One 32x32 RGBA PNG with transparent exterior and intentionally fractional-alpha edge/material regions. Save/reopen preserves visible RGBA and alpha values. Exact RGB palette membership is unrestricted; no binary-alpha thresholding. Retain source, export, hash and alpha distribution.;dm=mechanical;md=local;nm=~36:Sample raster and alpha preservation;so=[@s.brief,@s.measure,@s.research];wh=@actor}
@q.sample-style:Q{ck=~295:Inspect actual sample beside reference at 1x and 8x on light #F0E8D8, dark #18222E and checker. Handle, cap, base and warm light read as a lantern; navy structure, teal body and warm focal hierarchy retain the source's flat block style; partially transparent edges remain visible and controlled.;dm=visual;md=visual;nm=~26:Lantern identity and style;so=[@s.visual,@s.brief];wh=@actor}
